# expect.stdout: 14\n
# expect.exit: 0
project FourArgUserOp
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder CSignedInt32

operation fmaInt
input operation fmaInt a CSignedInt64
input operation fmaInt b CSignedInt64
input operation fmaInt c CSignedInt64
input operation fmaInt d CSignedInt64
output operation fmaInt Result CSignedInt64 Void
memory fmaInt heap no
async fmaInt no
purpose operation fmaInt "Compute a*b + c*d using four CSignedInt64 inputs. Exercises a 4-arg user-op call site emission path."
invariant operation fmaInt "All four inputs are i64."
label startFmaInt
call mulAbCall math.multiplyI64
argument mulAbCall left CSignedInt64 a
argument mulAbCall right CSignedInt64 b
run mulAbCall
bind value ab CSignedInt64 mulAbCall
call mulCdCall math.multiplyI64
argument mulCdCall left CSignedInt64 c
argument mulCdCall right CSignedInt64 d
run mulCdCall
bind value cd CSignedInt64 mulCdCall
call sumCall math.addI64
argument sumCall left I64 ab
argument sumCall right I64 cd
run sumCall
bind value total CSignedInt64 sumCall
return ok total

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "fmaInt(2,3,4,2) == 2*3 + 4*2 == 14."
invariant operation main "Exercises a 4-arg user-op call from main."
label startMain
storage module immutable twoVal CSignedInt64 2
storage module immutable threeVal CSignedInt64 3
storage module immutable fourVal CSignedInt64 4
storage module immutable anotherTwo CSignedInt64 2
call computeCall fmaInt
argument computeCall a CSignedInt64 twoVal
argument computeCall b CSignedInt64 threeVal
argument computeCall c CSignedInt64 fourVal
argument computeCall d CSignedInt64 anotherTwo
run computeCall
bind ok computedTotal CSignedInt64 computeCall
memory main mutable totalStorage I64 0
set memory totalStorage computedTotal
call writeCall console.writeIntegerLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall value I64 totalStorage
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode
